==History==
2022
*The Monk [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 26/10/2022, in the [[Version History#2022%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]].
*On 2/11/2022, a [[Version History#Maintenance%20Break%20(2/11/2022)|maintenance break]], increased the Pensive Protection's cooldown time to 17 seconds (from 15 seconds).
*On 7/12/2022, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(7/12/2022)|Balance Update]], increased the Monk's cost to 5 [[Elixir]] (from 4 Elixir).
*On 12/12/2022, the [[Version History#Clashmas%20Update%20(12/12/2022)|Clashmas Update]], made it so that the [[Heal Spirit]]'s projectile can no longer be deflected by the Monk.
2023
*On 7/2/2023, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (7/2/2023)|Balance Update]], decreased the Monk's attack time interval to 0.8 seconds (from 0.9 seconds).
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
2024
*On 5/3/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (5/3/2024)|Balance Update]], increased the Monk's hitpoints by 7.5%.
*On 17/6/2024, the [[Version History#Goblin World Update (17/6/2024)|Goblin World Update]], increased the Monk's combo damage by 0.47%. It also fixed certain issues with damage multipliers on the Monk.
2025
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], fixed various issues related to Pensive Protection.
*On 8/7/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/7/2025)|Balance Update]], increased the Monk's hitpoints by 3%, and decreased the Pensive Protection's damage reduction boost to 65% (from 80%).
*On 24/11/2025, a Balance Update made Monk no longer immune to the knockback effects of Evolved Mega Knight and another Monk. He is also no longer immune to [[Fireball]] and [[Giant Snowball]]'s knockbacks if those spells hit the Monk on the corner of their Area of Effect.
*On 12/12/2025, a Balance Update made Monk immune to any knockback.

